  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Library catalog",
    "overview": "This interface is a readable working catalog. White reading surfaces, slate navigation and restrained teal actions support repeated searching and close inspection. Compact labels and aligned record rules give evidence a consistent place without crowding the business name.\n\nThe implemented system uses borders and tonal changes for everyday structure. Selection connects a record with its evidence; website assessments remain written labels so color supplements their meaning. The chosen code-led direction is recorded in the interface brief; reference images are development material.",
